    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ier10">
        <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e98">Caput 10</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e104">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0024B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e108" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_1@1-2">Audite verbum,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e111"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e112" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e115"><seg type="qs">Proprie adversus eos loquitur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et ex causis coelestium moderentur terrena.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e124">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e126">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e128">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e130" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_3@7-7">Lignum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e133"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e134" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e137"><seg type="qs">Quod de idolis diximus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">propria est et eorum qui ignorant Deum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e146">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e148">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e150">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e152" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_4@1-3">Argento et auro.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e155"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e156" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e159">Ut fulgore materiae simplices occupet et decipiat. Hic error usque ad nos pervenit, ut religionem in divitiis arbitremur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e163">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e165">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e167">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e169" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_5@15-17">Nolite ergo timere.</quote>
            Solent plerique gentium daemones colere ne officiant, et alios exorare, ut proficiant: unde Virgilius, <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e172">Aeneid.</quote> III: <l>Nigram hiemi pecudem, zephyris felicibus albam.</l>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e179">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e181">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e183">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e185" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_6@1-4">Non est similis tui.</quote>
            Non est similis tui <pb ed="#P" n="0024C"/> Domine, deorum, scilicet qui ab haereticis finguntur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e194">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_7@8-10">Tuum est enim.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e201"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e202" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e205">Quamvis haeretici juxta sapientiam mundi, etc., <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e207" source="http://scta.info/resource/Icor1_19@4-10">usque ad Perdam sapientiam sapientium, et prudentiam prudentium reprobabo</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e213">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e215">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e217">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e219" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_9@2-2">Involutum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e222"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e223" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e226"><seg type="qs">Aliter non decipit; falsitas involvitur, veritas</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">dum coeli sibi colorem ostendunt, et coelestia promittunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e235">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e237">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e239">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e241" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_11@7-9">Coelos et terram.</quote>
            Quae cooperatores Christi, qui dii vocantur et domini, per doctrinam ecclesiasticam partim fecerunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e246">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e248">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e250">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e252" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_12@1-5">Qui facit. Dominus qui facit terram in fortitudine,</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e255"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e256" ref="#Origen">ORIG.</name>, Homil. in Jer.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e260"><seg type="qs">etc. Tres quodammodo virtutes Dei assumens propheta</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">si vero coelestia, thesaurizatorem suum ad propinquam <pb ed="#P" n="0024D"/> sibi regionem subvehunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e271">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e273">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e275">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e277" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_13@11-11">Nebulas.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e280"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e281" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e284">Quae noverunt scilicet quibus pluvias suspendant et quibus impendant: Moyses quasi nubes loquebatur, qui dicebat, <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e286" source="http://scta.info/resource/ex9">Exspectet terra, ut pluviam verba mea<!-- check: cited chapter given; verse not identified --></quote>. Et Isaias: <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e290" source="http://scta.info/resource/is1_2@1-10">Audi, coelum, et auribus percipe, terra, quia Dominus locutus est</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e295">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e297" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_13@12-13">Ab extremitatibus.</quote>
            Qui vult in vobis primus esse, sit omnium novissimus. Aliter enim nemo fit nubes.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e301">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e303" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_13@15-17">Fulgura in pluvias.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e306"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e307" ref="#Origen">ORIG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e310"><seg type="qs">Fertur quod fulgura ex nubium vel imbrium collisione generantur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Jeremias quoque et Baruch sibi colloquentes rutilantia fulgura mittunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e318">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e320" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_13@19-23">Et educit ventum de thesauris.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e323"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e324" ref="#Origen">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e327"><seg type="qs">Venti qui terras <pb ed="#P" n="0025A"/> perflant in thesauris Dei non sunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">inde oritur ut alius sit sapiens, alius fidelis et hujusmodi.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e339">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e341">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e343">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e345" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_14@1-1">Stultus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e348"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e349" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e352"><seg type="qs">Stultus comparatione Dei</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">omnia enim contraria assumpsit Deus, ut contraria dissolvat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e360">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e362" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_14@15-16">Falsum est.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e365"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e366" ref="#Origen">ORIG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e369">Quod ordine suo fingit. Falsum est enim quod conflavit, sicut stultus est omnis homo a scientia, stultum etiam est quod facit.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e372">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e374" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_14@20-22">Non est spiritus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e377"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e378" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e381">Notandum quod in hoc capite ventus et spiritus uno nomine apud Hebraeos appellantur <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e383">ruah.</quote></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e387">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e389">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e391">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e393" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_15@1-2">Vana sunt.</quote>
            Aut enim rustica sunt, ut lignum, aut pulchro sermone tinnientia, ut argentum; aut de proprio sensu simulata mentiuntur, ut <pb ed="#P" n="0025B"/> aurum.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e399">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e401" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_15@7-9">In tempore visitationis.</quote>
            Ad tempus valet haeresis, ut qui <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e404" source="http://scta.info/resource/Icor11_19@9-12">probati sunt manifesti fiant</quote>. Cum autem visitatio Dei venerit, et oculus ejus cuncta respexerit, omnia conticescent.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e409">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e411">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e413">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e415" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_17@1-1">Congrega.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e418"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e419" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e422">Praecipitur Jerusalem ut quidquid substantiae foris habet, in urbem munitissimam congreget, et longe obsidioni praeparet alimenta. Non enim Deus, sicut prius, longe post futura minatus, sed statim futura.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e426">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e428">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e430">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e432" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_19@1-2">Vae mihi,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e435"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e436" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e439">Conqueritur Jerusalem quod vehementer afflicta sit et plaga insanabili.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e443">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e445">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e447">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e449" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_20@1-1">Tabernaculum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e452"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e453" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e456"><seg type="qs">Plangit Jerusalem tam facilem factam subversionem suam</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">magna pars eorum interfecta atque deleta <pb ed="#P" n="0025C"/> est.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e467">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e469">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e471">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e473" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_21@14-14">Grex.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e476"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e477" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e480">Septuaginta: <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e482">pecora.</quote> Quod juxta historiam stare non potest: in tam longa enim obsidione pecora non durassent.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e488">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e490">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e492">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e494" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_22@1-2">Vox auditionis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ier10-Rd1e497"><name xml:id="gom-ier10-Nd1e498" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e501"><seg type="qs">Haec omnia quae praeteritus et praesens sermo describit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e507" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_21@2-3">stulte egerunt,</quote> et Dominum non quaesierunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e512">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e514" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_22@18-18">Draconum.</quote>
            Vel <mentioned>Struthionum</mentioned>. Symmachus, <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e519">Syrenarum,</quote> ut pro hominibus habitent scilicet dracones, et omnia venenata: vel struthiones, quae solitudini familiares in desertis nascuntur et nutriuntur. Aut Syrenes, scilicet quaedam monstra et daemonum phantasmata.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e523">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e525">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e527">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e529" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_23@1-1">Scio,</quote>
            etc. Erubescant, qui aiunt unumquemque suo regi arbitrio. Non est enim hominis <pb ed="#P" n="0025D"/> via ejus, etc.; unde David: <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e534" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps36_23@2-5">A Domino gressus hominis dirigetur</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier10-Dd1e539">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier10-Hd1e541">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier10-d1e543">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e545" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier10_24@5-10">In judicio, et non in furore. (HIER)</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier10-Qd1e548"><seg type="qs">. Quasi, quae patimur, justa sunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">gentes autem, quae non cognoverunt te, non judicium, sed indignationem merentur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
